  "description": "The Engwe E26 is an all-terrain electric bike that's perfect for mountain biking enthusiasts and outdoor adventurers. With its powerful 750W motor, long-range 48V 16Ah battery, and full suspension design, the E26 can take you anywhere you want to go, no matter how challenging the terrain.\n\nHere's what makes the E26 stand out\n\n1、Powerful Performance: 750W motor and 48V 16Ah battery for tackling hills and rough terrain with ease.\n2、Unmatched Range: Enjoy up to 78 miles (125km) on a single charge, perfect for long rides and exploring new trails.\n3、Full Suspension Comfort: Front and rear suspension soak up bumps and keep you comfortable on even the most challenging rides.\n4、Durable Construction: All-aluminum frame and high-quality components ensure the E26 can handle anything you throw at it.\n5、Stylish Design: Eye-catching design that turns heads wherever you go.\n\nWhether you're looking for a powerful e-bike for conquering mountains or a comfortable and stylish ride for exploring the outdoors, the Engwe E26 is the perfect choice.",
